|------------------------------------------|
|                                          |
|     FALL3D dictionary for CARRA model    |
|                                          |
|------------------------------------------|
| READ_DIM |  DIM_DBS    |  DIM_CARRA      | 
|------------------------------------------|
|    1     |  DIM_LON    |  longitude      |
|    1     |  DIM_LAT    |  latitude       |
|    1     |  DIM_LEV    |  isobaricInhPa  |
|    1     |  DIM_TIME   |  time           |
|------------------------------------------|
| READ_VAR |  VAR_DBS    |  VAR_ERA5       |
|------------------------------------------|
|    1     |  VAR_LON    |  longitude      |  Longitudes (1D)
|    1     |  VAR_LAT    |  latitude       |  Latitudes (1D)
|    1     |  VAR_LEV    |  isobaricInhPa  |  Pressure levels (1D)
|    1     |  VAR_TIME   |  time           |  Time (1D)
|    1     |  VAR_TOPO   |  orog           |  Terrain height (m2/s2)
|    1     |  VAR_LMASK  |  lsm            |  Land-sea mask
|    1     |  VAR_Z0     |  sr             |  Surface roughness
|    1     |  VAR_U10    |  u10            |  U wind component at 10 m
|    1     |  VAR_V10    |  v10            |  V wind component at 10 m
|    1     |  VAR_T2     |  t2m            |  Temperature at 2 m
|    1     |  VAR_PSFC   |  sp             |  Surface pressure
|    1     |  VAR_HGT    |  z              |  Model level height (m2/s2)
|    1     |  VAR_T      |  t              |  Temperature
|    1     |  VAR_U      |  u              |  U wind component
|    1     |  VAR_V      |  v              |  V wind component
|    1     |  VAR_W      |  wz             |  W wind component
|    1     |  VAR_RH     |  r              |  Relative humidity
|    1     |  VAR_PBLH   |  pblh           |  PBL height (m)
|------------------------------------------|
